  4. VARISPEED BOUNDS SWEEP (port of libsamplerate varispeed_test.c)
     Hard ratio switches mid-stream across 1..9 channels. Asserts termination,
     non-empty output and no NaNs. #17's lesson: a ratio change is a buffer
     management bug generator before it is a quality problem.

     PASS - 54 cases, all terminated with finite output.

